L["Turn on Price checks and anyone who types !pc and an item in guild, party or raid chat gets its prices from you - market, lowest and 7-day average at your faction's auction house, and how old they are. When several players run AME, they agree among themselves and only one answers. Whispers can be answered too, for guild members, friends, your party or raid, and trusted players - never strangers. You answer at most once every 5 seconds - change it under Settings, Sharing - so nobody can make you flood the chat; while you wait, another AME player answers instead."] = true
